<title>UK: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 473-6 AT TEA ON FOURTH DAY THIRD TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 473-6 AT TEA ON FOURTH DAY THIRD TEST.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan were 473-6 at tea on the fourth day of the third and final test at The Oval on Sunday in reply to England's 326.</p>
<p>Scores: England 326; Pakistan 473-6.</p>
</text>
